				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>チコリータ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:27" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="ZKN_COMMENT_SPA_00_153"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>Su cuello desprende un dulce
aroma que anima a quien lo
huele.</Text>
